+# Torn Companion / BOSBOT 0.24.6
 
 The extension reads existing BOSBOT data. Provider keys, Discord credentials and site session cookies are never exported. Each browser must be explicitly approved by a logged-in account. Page permissions and account access are rechecked on every read, including after role changes. Members share the same observations; recommendations, favorites and travel are scoped to their account. No paid/admin-only extension gate is added.
 
@@ -16,13 +16,16 @@
 
 * War uses the portal's shared 60-second ranked-war cache and includes own/enemy score and lead target. Unknown scores/end times remain null.
 * Target source uses the existing personal BOSBOT ranking/assignments and shared 20-second live status. Missing members and mismatched war rosters are withheld. Real recorded provider estimates may be displayed with source/confidence; BOS level-model fallbacks are withheld. No strength-based recommendation is inferred from a fallback in the extension feed.
-* Hospital timers are enemy target statuses from the same current roster. Travel is only the paired user's linked member status from the shared 60-second faction cache. Unlinked/out-of-faction users get unavailable data.
-* Chain uses one shared 30-second central request with single-flight protection. Missing timeout stays null; relative timeout is anchored to the provider timestamp.
+* Hospital timers are enemy target statuses from the same current roster. Travel uses the paired BOSBOT account's verified private user/profile + user/travel cache (20 seconds). Without a personal key, a linked faction observation is used; faction status.until is never treated as a flight arrival time.
+* Chain uses one shared 10-second central request with single-flight protection. Missing timeout stays null; relative timeout is anchored to the provider timestamp.
 * Restock reuses the monitor's latest YATA payload when available, plus persistent interval history. Stale/out-of-order quantities become unknown. Predictions use the existing last-20, 5min–3h, weighted interval model; they are estimated windows, never exact schedules.
 * Legacy starred item favorites and enhanced item favorites can both be imported from the paired account. Import/local edits do not mutate Discord subscriptions. Country/category subscription types are not converted into item favorites.
 
+* All supported stock items include Cost, Torn value and separate market-value observation time. Unknown prices remain null; Chrome filters and calculates gross profit from this feed.
+* Company profile is checked against the verified account's Torn director ID every 60 seconds before fetching/exporting employees (180-second shared private cache). Only addiction effectiveness penalties are exported; not raw addiction points, wages or working stats.
+
 ## Deployment and rollback
 
